<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Showers seen in southern, central Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Showers seen in southern, central Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Monday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		0</p>
<p>    Canyon		    0</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     0</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  0</p>
<p>    Moussakele		0</p>
<p>    Norton		    0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   0</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0</p>
<p>The department forecast showers in the southwestern coastal areas in the morning and thundershowers at a few places in the Central and Uva provinces during the afternoon or night.</p>
</text>
